      "AUDREY: Really Drew? Skid marks on your underwear? Are you eight? Was I supposed to wash this for you? Is that why you dumped me? I didn’t mother yo…\nMORGAN: Fuck you and wipe your own ass!\nAUDREY: Your Fantasy Football trophy for SECOND place? And you saved it?\nMORGAN: It’s not even real football. It’s a fucking fantasy.",
      "AUDREY: We have to get the fuck out of here!\nMORGAN: Oh my God, Drew!\nAUDREY: We have to go. Now!",
      "AUDREY: I just killed someone... oh my god Morgan, I just killed someone...\nMORGAN: Don’t think about it! Keep running!\nAUDREY: I killed someone!\nMORGAN: Stop yelling that!",
      "AUDREY: Keep moving. There are cameras everywhere.\nMORGAN: I got us changes of clothes.\nMORGAN: They really play up that Mozart’s from here. Really downplay that Hitler’s from here.\nAUDREY: What else did you get?",
      "MORGAN: No, I get it. I get it.\nMORGAN: Thanks anyway. It was beautiful meeting you two.\nAUDREY: Have a great time in Poland.\nMORGAN: Now!"
    ]
